CC0 1.0 Universal — Public Domain Dedication

This license applies to the dataset and schema files in this repository:

    poems/                  (the curated poetry dataset, 3,424 JSON files)
    schema/                 (poetree.schema.json, poetree.values.json)
    sources/<id>/raw/       (raw HTML snapshots of public scholarly editions)
    sources/<id>/discovery/ (per-source discovery reports)
    deletion_log.txt, discovery_log.txt, scrape_log.txt (curation logs)

The poems themselves are drawn from public scholarly editions of works whose
authors have been dead for centuries (16th–19th c. Danish literature). The
curation, schema design, and JSON structuring in this repository are released
to the public domain by the contributor.


